# !!! Note: in my epoching file I have set the "buffer" to 0.05 but in one mne tutorial it says to set it like this:
#  "We’ll pass (0.05, 0.2) to interpolate_blinks(), expanding the interpolation window 50 ms before and 200 ms after the blink,""
